T CHARGE)  \n(DR. MAHESH SHARMA) \n \n(a): No, Madam.  \n \n(b): Does not arise.    \n \n******** \n \n "}, {"k": "questions|ls|16|10|UNSTARRED |783", "t": "Import of Edible Oils", "head": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF COMMERCE & INDUSTRY \n(DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE) \nLOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 783 \nTO BE ANSWERED ON 21st NOVEMBER, 2016 \n \nIMPORT OF EDIBLE OILS \n783.  SHRI Y.V. SUBBA REDDY: \nWill the Minister of COMMERCE & INDUSTRY (वाͨणÏय एवं उɮयोग मंğी ) be \npleased to state: \n(a) the details of edible oil imports into the country during the last three years and the current \nyear, year-wise and variety-wise; \n(b) the details of import bill of edible oils during the said period;  \n(c) the reaction of the Government to the clearance given by the Genetic Engineering \nAppraisal Committee (GEAC) to three varieties of GM Mustard and also terming them as \n'safe'; and  \n(d) whether safety data has been released to the general public to actually know how safe it is \nand if not, the reasons therefor? \nANSWER \nokf.kT; ,oa m|ksx jkT; ea=h ¼Jherh fueZyk lhrkje.k½ ¼Lora= izHkkj½ \nTHE MINISTER OF STATE IN THE MINISTRY OF COMMERCE AND INDUSTRY \n(INDEPENDENT CHARGE) \n(SMT. NIRMALA SITHARAMAN) \n \n(a) & (b) The quantity and value (import bill) of import of edible oil into the country during \nthe last three years and the current year are as follows: \nYears Quantity \n(in Millions Tonnes) \nValue \n (US$ Millions) \n2013-14 10.5 9389.7 \n2014-15 12.7 10621.5 \n2015-16 15.6 10492.1 \n2016-17  \n(Apr to Aug)* 5.6 4207.6 \n              Source: Directorate General of Commercial Intelligence & Statistics (* Provisional)  \n \nThe details of variety-wise edible oil imports into the country during last three years \nand current year is enclosed at Annexure-I. \n \n(c) The Government has not given any clearance for commercial cultivation of GM Mustard \ntill now.  \n\n(d) The Sub-Committee constituted by Genetic Engineering Appraisal Committee (GEAC) \nfor 